{
  "name": "Long-Running Job Notifier – Start & Completion Push",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1080, -80],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## ⏱️ Long-Running Job Notifier\n\nWrap any slow workflow (big export, batch import, video render, nightly ETL) so you get a push when it **starts** and another when it **finishes** — with the total duration. No more babysitting a tab.\n\n**The pattern:**\n```\nTrigger → Mark Start → [notify \"started\"]\n                    → ▶ your long job\n                    → Mark Done → [notify \"finished in 12m\"]\n```\nNotifications are side branches, so your job runs whether or not a channel is enabled.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Replace the **▶ Your Long Job Here** node with your actual work (or call this as a sub-workflow around it).\n2. Set the job name in the **Mark Start** node.\n3. Enable + configure your notification channel(s).\n4. Run it (Manual Trigger is here for testing — swap for your real trigger)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-job",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Your Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-300, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "## ▶ Replace this node\n\nThe **Wait** node simulates a slow job so you can see a real duration on the first test run. Delete it and put your actual workflow steps here — the timing and notifications keep working unchanged."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-start",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Start Notify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -420],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 320,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## 🚀 \"Started\" notification\n\nFires the moment the job begins. **Slack** enabled by default; **WorkflowBuddy** push ready below (enable it).\n\nWant Telegram/Email too? Copy a node from the *Finished* group and wire it to **Mark Start**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-done",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Done Notify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [620, -480],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 400,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## ✅ \"Finished\" notification — pick your channel(s)\n\nFires when the job completes, with the total duration.\n\n**Slack** is enabled by default. To use another channel, enable it and disable Slack:\n- **Telegram** — set your chat ID\n- **Email** — set from/to addresses\n- **WorkflowBuddy** — native iOS push, see the note below ⬇️"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-workflowbuddy",
      "name": "Sticky Note – WorkflowBuddy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [620, 360],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 420,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 📱 WorkflowBuddy (iOS push)\n\nGet start/finish pings as native push notifications on your iPhone — no Slack or Telegram needed.\n\n1. Install [**Workflow Buddy**](https://apps.apple.com/app/id6760253861) from the App Store.\n2. In the app, open **Settings → Push API** and copy your key.\n3. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer wb_…` (your key)\n4. Select the credential in the WorkflowBuddy node(s) and enable them.\n\n*Free tier currently includes 50 pushes/day. Tapping the notification opens the app.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-trigger",
      "name": "When clicking ‘Test’",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-560, -80],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "node-mark-start",
      "name": "Mark Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-340, -80],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Capture the job name and start time. Edit JOB_NAME to suit.\nconst JOB_NAME = 'Nightly Export';\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      jobName: JOB_NAME,\n      startMs: Date.now(),\n      startedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n    },\n  },\n];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-long-job",
      "name": "▶ Your Long Job Here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-100, -80],
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "seconds"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-mark-done",
      "name": "Mark Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [180, -80],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Compute how long the job took.\nconst start = $('Mark Start').first().json;\nconst elapsedMs = Date.now() - start.startMs;\nconst mins = Math.floor(elapsedMs / 60000);\nconst secs = Math.round((elapsedMs % 60000) / 1000);\nconst durationText = mins > 0 ? `${mins}m ${secs}s` : `${secs}s`;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      jobName: start.jobName,\n      durationText,\n      elapsedMs,\n      finishedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n    },\n  },\n];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-start-slack",
      "name": "Start: Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-100, -340],
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#jobs"
        },
        "text": "=🚀 Started: {{ $('Mark Start').first().json.jobName }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-start-workflowbuddy",
      "name": "Start: WorkflowBuddy (iOS Push)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-100, -540],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://companion.amelus.de/api/notify",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "title",
              "value": "=🚀 Job started"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $('Mark Start').first().json.jobName }} is now running."
            },
            {
              "name": "severity",
              "value": "info"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-done-slack",
      "name": "Done: Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [620, -180],
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#jobs"
        },
        "text": "=✅ Finished: {{ $json.jobName }} in {{ $json.durationText }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-done-telegram",
      "name": "Done: Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [620, 20],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "YOUR_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=✅ Finished: {{ $json.jobName }} in {{ $json.durationText }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-done-email",
      "name": "Done: Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [620, 160],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "alerts@example.com",
        "toEmail": "you@example.com",
        "subject": "=✅ Finished: {{ $json.jobName }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "={{ $json.jobName }} finished in {{ $json.durationText }}.",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-done-workflowbuddy",
      "name": "Done: WorkflowBuddy (iOS Push)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [620, 300],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://companion.amelus.de/api/notify",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "title",
              "value": "=✅ Job finished"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.jobName }} finished in {{ $json.durationText }}."
            },
            {
              "name": "severity",
              "value": "info"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking ‘Test’": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Mark Start", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
